# === SECURITY: Secrets and credentials ===
# API keys, tokens, OAuth credentials — NEVER commit these
secrets/
*.secret
*.credentials
*.token
oauth_tokens/
credentials/

# === PRIVATE DATA: Personal account spaces ===
# Any directory named 'private/' anywhere in the tree is gitignored
# This is the secure staging area for personal data before Hypernet ingestion
**/private/

# Specific private data paths
Hypernet Structure/1 - People/*/private/

# === SEPARATE-PROJECT DEMO DATA: do NOT publish ===
# The 3.2 node is an example law firm built for a DIFFERENT project.
# Excluded from the public repo by Matt's directive (2026-05-28).
Hypernet Structure/3 - Businesses/3.2 - Florida Man and Associates LLP (Demo)/

# === PERSONAL JOB-SEARCH / RESUME MATERIALS (PII) — do NOT publish ===
# Resumes, cover letters, salary strategy, recruiter notes, current-employer
# details. The private/job-search/ copies are already protected above; these are
# the duplicate public-path copies. Excluded by Matt's directive (2026-05-28).
/Matt-Schaeffer-Senior-Infrastructure-Engineer.md
Hypernet Structure/1 - People/1.1 Matt Schaeffer/1.1.2 - Documents/1.1.2.1 - Business Documents/

# Coordination messages about the job search (PII) and the FMA/3.2 demo
# (separate project) — keep both out of the public repo, per exclusions above.
Hypernet Structure/2 - AI Accounts/Messages/coordination/*-resume-*
Hypernet Structure/2 - AI Accounts/Messages/coordination/*-polsinelli-*
Hypernet Structure/2 - AI Accounts/Messages/coordination/*-fma-*

# === PRIVACY WALL: 1.* personal accounts ===
# Per 1.0.3-PRIVACY-WALL-STANDARD.md (added 2026-05-08), 1.* personal accounts
# default to private-track for personal context. The directory structure
# (READMEs, registries, public-track plans, public-track essays) stays public,
# but file categories that are inherently personal-context are gitignored
# even if someone re-creates them under public paths.

# Embassy personal context (companion's living memory of the principal)
**/shared-context/family.md
**/shared-context/priorities.md
**/embassy/*/context.md
**/embassy/*/preferences.md
**/embassy/*/context-dumps/
**/embassy/*/morning-brief/
**/embassy/*/session-log/

# Personal contact details (phone, personal email, addresses) — keep public
# contact.json present at the public address but block private contact files
**/contact-private.json
**/contact-private.md
**/private-contact.*

# Health, financial, biometric, legal records under any 1.* account
**/health-records/
**/financial-records/
**/medical/
**/biometric/
**/legal-private/
**/insurance/
**/tax/

# Family-private records
**/family-records/
**/relationships-private/
**/child-records/

# Travel logs and location histories (geotagged data)
**/location-history/
**/travel-log-private/
**/geotagged/

# Brain-dump raw captures (Matt's stream-of-consciousness sources)
**/brain-dumps-raw/
**/raw-brain-dumps/

# === SENSITIVE IMPORTS: Raw data staging ===
# Email exports, photo imports, social media dumps
**/import-staging/
**/raw-imports/

# === LOCAL RUNTIME ===
# Database files, local caches, session data
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
Hypernet Structure/lmdb/
local-cache/
.session-data/

# === LOGS WITH POTENTIAL PII ===
logs/*.log
*.log.gz

# Harness/runtime state — never track
.claude/
